// ============================================================
// Drop the investigation graph and all of its types.
// Run from the graph/ directory:
//   gsql drop_schema.gsql
// Then rebuild with:
//   gsql setup.gsql
//
// First install: skip this file if the graph does not exist yet
// (DROP will error and stop the GSQL client).
// ============================================================

USE GLOBAL

DROP GRAPH FraudInvestigationGraph CASCADE
DROP EDGE MEMORY_OF
DROP EDGE CONNECTED_TO
DROP EDGE ON_CARD
DROP EDGE INVOLVES
DROP EDGE NEXT
DROP EDGE BILLED_IN
DROP EDGE PURCHASER_EMAIL
DROP EDGE FROM_DEVICE
DROP EDGE MADE
DROP EDGE OWNS
DROP VERTEX ClosedCase
DROP VERTEX CaseMemory
DROP VERTEX BillingRegion
DROP VERTEX EmailDomain
DROP VERTEX DeviceProfile
DROP VERTEX Transaction
DROP VERTEX Card
DROP VERTEX Customer
